{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Savanna Sam</strong> is a <strong>3D action game</strong> where you take over the controls of Sam\u2019s trusty biplane and help him on his dangerous journey. Make sure Sam reaches his destination and can make his delivery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay of Savanna Sam is similar to console classic <strong>Star Fox</strong>, replacing the shooting with even more barrel rolls!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evade all obstacles</strong> in the colorful levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure both Sam and his plane reach the end of the level without a scratch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect</strong> all the <strong>golden rings and items</strong> popping up throughout the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rotate</strong> Sam to fit through any gap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Sam\u2019s neck to collect even hard to reach items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through the <strong>story mode</strong> to see how Sam\u2019s adventure unfolds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to make the trip through the Savanna?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3038250?t=1744450537","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038250/e9e3b183566a4cda0c0ce6789d1312dcfddcc2b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744450537","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038250/95103a6cbeb8f2ab219e6ea44a885b455e598a65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744450537","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038250/95103a6cbeb8f2ab219e6ea44a885b455e598a65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744450537","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Savanna Sam</strong> is a <strong>3D action game</strong> where you take over the controls of Sam\u2019s trusty biplane and help him on his dangerous journey. Make sure Sam reaches his destination and can make his delivery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay of Savanna Sam is similar to console classic <strong>Star Fox</strong>, replacing the shooting with even more barrel rolls!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evade all obstacles</strong> in the colorful levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure both Sam and his plane reach the end of the level without a scratch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect</strong> all the <strong>golden rings and items</strong> popping up throughout the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rotate</strong> Sam to fit through any gap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Sam\u2019s neck to collect even hard to reach items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through the <strong>story mode</strong> to see how Sam\u2019s adventure unfolds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to make the trip through the Savanna?</p>","developers":["Max Did It"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038250/ff0fc1157bb42835aa36078fb2f25eaceaa3225f/header.jpg?t=1744450537","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Savanna Sam","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true